sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant D as Device
    participant C as Client App
    participant M as Security Middleware
    participant A as Auth Service
    participant S as Security Service
    participant DB as Database

    Note over U,DB: Registration Flow with Anti-Spoofing

    U->>D: Biometric Input
    D->>D: Liveness Check
    D->>C: WebAuthn Credential
    C->>M: Registration Request
    M->>M: Rate Limit Check
    M->>M: Device Fingerprint
    M->>A: Validated Request
    A->>S: Security Validation
    S->>S: Presentation Attack Detection
    S->>S: Credential Uniqueness Check
    A->>DB: Store Encrypted Credential
    DB->>A: Success
    A->>C: Registration Complete

    Note over U,DB: Authentication Flow with Enhanced Security

    U->>D: Biometric Input
    D->>D: Liveness Validation
    D->>C: WebAuthn Response
    C->>M: Auth Request
    M->>M: Device Consistency Check
    M->>M: Anti-Replay Validation
    M->>A: Validated Request
    A->>S: Behavioral Analysis
    S->>S: Suspicious Activity Check
    S->>S: Sign Count Validation
    A->>DB: Verify Credential
    DB->>A: Credential Valid
    A->>S: Log Security Event
    A->>C: Authentication Success
